To import this dataset:

# Use Pouchitis-dada2.rds for dada2-processed version
# Use pouchitis-qiime.rds for qiime-processed version

pouchitis<-readRDS(file = "~/Micro336-master/Assessment/Dataset-pouchitis/pouchitis.rds")

This data is from the following manuscript:

https://genomebiology.biomedcentral.com/articles/10.1186/s13059-015-0637-x

